# Build outputs
main

# zkDilithium — the Rust source is cloned and built by the Makefile at the
# revision pinned in ZK_REV, and is not tracked.
zkDilithiumProof/

# The built archives under lib/<goos>_<goarch>/ ARE tracked, so that consumers
# can `go get` pq-gabi and run its tests without a Rust toolchain. Regenerate
# with `make build` (host) or `make build-linux-amd64` / `build-ios` /
# `build-android`. Only the per-platform build stamp is ignored.
lib/**/.zk-rev

